// Notice the -f, --force / -F, --no-force
Usage: main.py [OPTIONS]

Options:
  -f, --force / -F, --no-force  [default: False]
  --help                        Show this message and exit.

// Try with the short name -f
$ python main.py -f

Forcing operation

// Try with the short name -F
$ python main.py -F

Not forcing
